  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "description": "Validate a lead, check for duplicates against the existing sheet BEFORE spending an LLM call or writing a row, enrich with an ICP score, and tag hot/warm/cold. A failed enrichment yields needs_review, not a fabricated score.",
